{"D:\\wt\\ssimple4\\vlog\\ssimple4\\voz\\b005_t4.wav": {"text": "Every Sunday afternoon, after lunch, she sat at the low table with her good pen and wrote one letter by hand. To me, far away, to my brothers, to a cousin in the countryside, to her old teacher, to a neighbor who moved away. One letter, every week, for more than thirty years. She bought her stamps ten at a time. When people wrote back, she kept the letters in an old biscuit tin, and on rainy days she read them again. When the tin was full, she started a second tin and then a third. She said, the telephone is for news, but a letter is for feelings, and you cannot hold a telephone call in your hand when you miss somebody. Most people today send a quick message on the phone and forget it in one minute. A letter, she said, somebody keeps. I still have 140 of her letters. Every one starts the same way, with the weather in Osaka. Write one letter this Sunday.", "words": [{"w": " Every", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.28}, {"w": " Sunday", "s": 0.28, "e": 0.76}, {"w": " afternoon,", "s": 0.76, "e": 1.38}, {"w": " after", "s": 1.38, "e": 2.16}, {"w": " lunch,", "s": 2.16, "e": 3.02}, {"w": " she", "s": 3.02, "e": 3.1}, {"w": " sat", "s": 3.1, "e": 3.38}, {"w": " at", "s": 3.38, "e": 3.56}, {"w": " the", "s": 3.56, "e": 3.78}, {"w": " low", "s": 3.78, "e": 3.96}, {"w": " table", "s": 3.96, "e": 4.3}, {"w": " with", "s": 4.3, "e": 4.62}, {"w": " her", "s": 4.62, "e": 4.76}, {"w": " good", "s": 4.76, "e": 5.06}, {"w": " pen", "s": 5.06, "e": 5.42}, {"w": " and", "s": 5.42, "e": 5.92}, {"w": " wrote", "s": 5.92, "e": 6.2}, {"w": " one", "s": 6.2, "e": 6.52}, {"w": " letter", "s": 6.52, "e": 6.88}, {"w": " by", "s": 6.88, "e": 7.12}, {"w": " hand.", "s": 7.12, "e": 7.56}, {"w": " To", "s": 8.14, "e": 8.16}, {"w": " me,", "s": 8.16, "e": 8.7}, {"w": " far", "s": 8.7, "e": 9.08}, {"w": " away,", "s": 9.08, "e": 9.62}, {"w": " to", "s": 9.62, "e": 9.92}, {"w": " my", "s": 9.92, "e": 10.06}, {"w": " brothers,", "s": 10.06, "e": 10.9